@startuml
title S2 - Approve or reject a dispatch task (UC-M4-02): proposed interaction contract
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
hide footbox
actor Operator
boundary UI
control Allocation
control Core
control Reservation
Operator -> UI: Choose task and decision
alt Operator approves (optional lower quantity)
  UI -> Allocation: approve_task(task_id, qty, command key)
  Allocation -> Allocation: Check task is Recommended (BR-M4-08)
  Allocation -> Core: Begin unit of work on a fresh snapshot (version)
  Allocation -> Allocation: Re-check BR-M4-02..07 on the fresh snapshot
  alt Conditions still valid
    group Atomic Core-coordinated unit of work (BR-M4-04, BR-M4-07)
      Allocation -> Reservation: Create system reservation (purpose REBALANCE):\nvehicle claim + destination space hold
      Reservation -> Core: Apply claims, Vehicle Reserved
    end
    Core --> Allocation: Committed (new version)
    Allocation -> Allocation: Task Approved; log transition (BR-M4-12)
    Allocation --> UI: Approved
  else Conditions changed or a competing claim won
    Allocation -> Core: Roll back (nothing held)
    Allocation -> Allocation: Task Failed with reason code; log
    Allocation --> UI: Failed (reason), offer to re-plan
  end
else Operator rejects
  UI -> Allocation: reject_task(task_id)
  Allocation -> Allocation: Task Rejected; log
  Allocation --> UI: Rejected
end
UI --> Operator: Show result
@enduml
